Babakocsi Lionelo Mira, Grey Graphite:





	The Lionelo Mira pushchair is suitable for children from 6 to 48 months (up to 22kg). This durable, agile and comfortable pushchair is ideal for the city, but thanks to its large, maintenance-free PU wheels and dual suspension, it can also handle moderately challenging terrain. The front wheels rotate 360° and can be locked. It offers adjustable positioning for the backrest (3 positions), footrest (8 positions) and parent handle (5 positions), so it adapts perfectly to everyone. The backrest can be reclined to a fully flat position, giving your little one up to 92cm of space. The footrest features a clean zone for easy cleaning. The XXL canopy is waterproof and equipped with a UPF50+ sun filter for high protection. It includes an additional zip-in panel, a ventilation window and a sun visor. A conveniently accessible pocket is perfect for storing your mobile phone or keys.&nbsp;


















